    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d444">

                <pb facs="0541" n="437" xml:id="pg437"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/960.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American Minister.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-11-24T20:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 24, 1913—8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In regard to your telegram of the 13th instant in regard to removal of vessels,
                    you are advised that the <hi rendition="#italic">Nashville</hi> will proceed to
                    Santiago de Cuba for about a fortnight and will be back at her station in
                    Dominican waters about the 10th of December, in sufficient time for any service
                    in relation to the election.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
